    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your melee attacks can catch bystanders.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you damage a target with a single, non-<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a> Feat, once per turn on your turn, you can immediately make a second attack at a -2 penalty against a second target within your reach. If this attack hits, you deal half of the original attack's damage to that target.</p>",
